;
; How Treadle files a task in MYRA: its number, its kind (0 on a schedule,
; 1 on an event), the minute of the day it starts, its period in minutes,
; its cost in tokens and whether the owner approved it (1) or it is held
; (0). The rules say what the values may mean; this says whether they make
; a record.
^ZXTREADLE(task:i3) = kind:i1! ^ start:i4! ^ period:i4! ^ cost:i9! ^ approved:i1!
